  "title": "Calimero",
  "justification": "Each of the 45 AniDB episodes is one broadcast holding two stories, which TVDB season 1 lists separately, 90 in all: episode 1 \"Buzzer wa Daiseikou (Zen) / (Go)\" is episodes 1-2 \"The Bazaar Is a Great Success (1)/(2)\", episode 2 \"Tamago no Boushi wa Subarashii / Chikoku Sensou\" is 3-4 \"The Egg Hat Is Great / Delay Conflict\", episode 12 \"Kikansha Dick / Uchuu ga Boku o Yonde Iru\" is 23-24 \"Locomotive Dick / The Universe Is Calling Me\", and so on to 45. By default episode k fell on episode k.",
